WEBVTT

00:00.610 --> 00:04.014
Usasa usasa usasa,

00:04.014 --> 00:07.818
usasa usasa usasa,

00:07.818 --> 00:13.154
usasa u-sa-sa!

00:20.664 --> 00:22.999
Wow, it's so pretty.

00:22.999 --> 00:26.833
It makes me feel like I can just forget
about all the tough times...

00:27.471 --> 00:28.472
Excuse me.

00:28.472 --> 00:29.769
Huh?

00:35.278 --> 00:36.480
Yes? Can I help you?

00:36.480 --> 00:39.074
Could you be unhappy?

00:43.086 --> 00:44.588
Pardon?

00:44.588 --> 00:46.757
Please be unhappy.

00:46.757 --> 00:49.793
Um, might I ask who you are?

00:49.793 --> 00:51.795
Oh, I'm sorry that I didn't introduce
myself sooner.

00:51.795 --> 00:55.595
My name is Taeko, the jinx trainee.

00:55.932 --> 00:58.769
So you jinx people.

00:58.769 --> 00:59.736
Yes.

00:59.736 --> 01:04.441
Um, actually I was just enjoying
a moment of happiness.

01:04.441 --> 01:08.812
But an unhappy aura is oozing
out of your entire body.

01:08.812 --> 01:10.013
Huh?

01:10.013 --> 01:12.616
It is. A lot.

01:12.616 --> 01:14.384
Is that so?

01:14.384 --> 01:15.510
Yes.

01:19.055 --> 01:21.324
I'm not full-fledged yet,

01:21.324 --> 01:23.827
so I'm still not very good at
making people unhappy.

01:23.827 --> 01:26.663
But you look like you can be
made unhappy easily,

01:26.663 --> 01:29.963
so please, be unhappy for me!

01:30.834 --> 01:35.105
Well, that's not really something
I feel comfortable saying "yes" to...

01:35.105 --> 01:36.673
Please!

01:36.673 --> 01:38.971
But still...

01:39.576 --> 01:41.806
What should I do...

01:47.117 --> 01:50.086
It was still half-full...

01:50.086 --> 01:52.589
Are you unhappy right now, by any chance?

01:52.589 --> 01:53.723
I am unhappy...

01:53.723 --> 01:55.759
Is it because of me?

01:55.759 --> 01:57.994
No, I wasn't being careful enough.

01:57.994 --> 02:00.554
You didn't do anything wrong, Taeko.

02:00.764 --> 02:02.994
