05:17.093 --> 05:17.327
Tee-hee! I'm sorry!

05:17.327 --> 05:19.362
Tee-hee! I'm sorry!

05:19.362 --> 05:22.432
She's so upbeat... I just can't
get mad at her any more...

05:22.432 --> 05:24.801
