07:41.704 --> 07:43.740
My skirt! My skirt!

07:43.740 --> 07:46.342
My skirt! My skirt! My skirt!

07:46.342 --> 07:48.745
It's gone! It's gone!

07:48.745 --> 07:50.770
They're gone...

07:51.114 --> 07:53.640
They didn't have to run away like that...

08:01.191 --> 08:03.057
It's you.

08:05.828 --> 08:07.297
So you're unhappy, right?

08:07.297 --> 08:08.998
