it's a Christmas gift for you!

08:22.812 --> 08:24.143
It's TOO early!

08:24.948 --> 08:26.649
Please take it off!

08:26.649 --> 08:27.951
I can't do that.

08:27.951 --> 08:29.886
Please!

08:29.886 --> 08:32.589
It was given to me, so I wouldn't know how.

08:32.589 --> 08:33.957
But you DID put it on me...

08:33.957 --> 08:34.757
Yes!

08:34.757 --> 08:37.026
Who did you get it from?

08:37.026 --> 08:38.926
Some guy I don't know.

08:43.233 --> 08:44.462
You're unhappy, aren't you?

08:44.867 --> 08:47.097
What's going to happen to me?

08:47.604 --> 08:48.696
E-X-P-L-O-D-E!

08:54.711 --> 08:56.546
It was a very short life...

08:56.546 --> 08:59.682
It feels like there are so many things
that I should've done,

08:59.682 --> 09:01.480
or maybe it doesn't...

09:02.018 --> 09:03.486
Huh? Wait.

09:04.254 --> 09:05.221
Oh, I know!

09:05.221 --> 09:08.748
All we have to do is find the guy
who gave you this bomb!

09:09.859 --> 09:12.988
Taeko, I'm sure he knows how
to take this thing off...

09:13.763 --> 09:15.527
She's gone...

09:19.068 --> 09:21.004
Amore... Capore...

09:21.004 --> 09:21.971
There he goes again.

09:21.971 --> 09:24.167
He's been that way ever since that incident.

09:27.744 --> 09:28.478
Captain.

09:28.478 --> 09:30.413
I'm okay. I'm not sleeping.

09:30.413 --> 09:31.514
I'm aware of that.

09:31.514 --> 09:32.615
