09:44.494 --> 09:46.496
I see. Ichijo Festival?

09:46.496 --> 09:49.032
It's a unique item, so we transferred it.

09:49.032 --> 09:50.133
This "Ichijo Festival."

09:50.133 --> 09:52.435
I see... You went out of your way
to get this Ichijo Festival...

09:52.435 --> 09:53.002
I'm sorry for worrying you guys.

09:53.002 --> 09:55.238
I'm sorry for worrying you guys.

09:55.238 --> 09:56.839
