10:23.199 --> 10:25.101
Give me a break...

10:25.101 --> 10:26.302
Sorry about that!

10:26.302 --> 10:29.038
You went through all the trouble
to get this Ichijo Festival, so...

10:29.038 --> 10:29.739
Um, anyway...

10:29.739 --> 10:30.006
Um, anyway...

10:30.006 --> 10:31.240
