11:22.358 --> 11:25.228
Oh, I totally recognized you!

11:25.228 --> 11:27.263
You looked shocked just now.

11:27.263 --> 11:28.998
Wh-What are you talking about?

11:28.998 --> 11:32.628
I wasn't shocked at all! Right, Iguyo?

11:34.670 --> 11:36.139
Yeah, whatever.

11:36.139 --> 11:39.809
Anyhow, what is that strange
outfit you're wearing?

11:39.809 --> 11:41.644
