11:41.644 --> 11:43.874
I don't want to hear that from someone
walking around with a damn iguana on a leash!

11:44.147 --> 11:45.915
So is this your part-time job?

11:45.915 --> 11:48.050
Yup! As you can see
I work for a Chinese restaurant!

11:48.050 --> 11:49.540
I'm on my way to deliver some food.

11:50.253 --> 11:54.290
