you hired that part-timer?

17:39.168 --> 17:40.002
Exactly.

17:40.002 --> 17:42.027
She's friendly, but she has no moe factor!

17:42.271 --> 17:43.205
Exactly.

17:43.205 --> 17:45.037
She's full of energy, but she has no moe factor!

17:45.307 --> 17:46.041
Exactly.

17:46.041 --> 17:48.066
